zing dispositions (merged/addressed/closed).","activeForm":"Issue comments + Peyton message","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"78","subject":"Build graph/semantic source for 4 product-repo brains","description":"Run refresh sessions + history + index (semantic via entire sem) for cli, entire-api, entire.io, entiredb. Verify semantic:true and no repo tree dirtied. Phase 1, running as 4 bg jobs.","activeForm":"Building graph/semantic source for 4 repos","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"79","subject":"Distill facts — entire-api (haiku, finishing); cli partial; db/io skipped","description":"entire-api: resumed 90/230 on haiku (~$14, honors $25 cap), flushes facts at completion, monitored. cli: graph built + usable but facts ~29% partial (killed), left per skip-spend. entiredb + entire.io: skipped (no cross-repo yet). Agent-usage rule wired into ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md (global) + devenv/CLAUDE.md; entire-brain MCP global.","activeForm":"Distilling durable facts for 4 repos","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"80","subject":"Create devenv multi-repo brain workspace","description":"entire brain workspace create + add the 4 product repo keys so agents can query/search/review across all repos in one call.","activeForm":"Creating devenv brain workspace","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"81","subject":"Verify agents can query the brains end-to-end","description":"Test brain_query / brain_impact / workspace query against real repos; confirm structural + fact answers return. Report what agents now get.","activeForm":"Verifying agent brain queries","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"82","subject":"SWE-bench Multilingual: fetch + stratify ~30 pilot tasks","description":"Install datasets, load real SWE-bench_Multilingual, stratify 3-4 tasks/language across all 9, save pilot_tasks.json + print distribution.","activeForm":"Fetching + stratifying SWE-bench Multilingual pilot","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"83","subject":"Build 2-arm harness: mini-swe-agent +/- entire-graph","description":"Bake entire-sem into task containers, snapshot at base_commit, expose graph as bash tool in treated arm only. Same mini-swe-agent + Sonnet 5 both arms. Log tokens + tool calls per run.","activeForm":"Building 2-arm SWE-bench harness","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"84","subject":"Full official SWE-bench Multilingual (subscription): fix→rebuild→runner→await approval","description":"MEASURED-SETTLED: graph = token win (-19-23% vs whole-file-naive baseline, lean graph, full session), NOT accuracy lever (~0 across 4 configs: 100t +1/-3, enriched -3, budget40 -1). Enrichment + budget both backfired. Verdict in memory graph-swebench-verdict.md. No cheating.","activeForm":"Running pilot + scoring","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"85","subject":"git-meta-service: integrate → PR → audit","description":"DONE: feat/git-meta-service-integration → PR #1 (entirehq/git-meta-service). Finished auth build-tag gating (authn_dev.go), fixed create-race classifier + stale test. prod 48 tests, dev 54 tests, both build modes green. Audit skipped per user. Not merged.","activeForm":"Integrating + PR + audit for git-meta-service","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"86","subject":"Push agentic-swebench benchmark properly into brain-bench","description":"DONE: agentic-swebench suite pushed to entirehq/brain-bench PR #32 (branch agentic-swebench-suite off clean origin/main). Proper suite layout (tools/tasks/tests/results) matching competitive-eval, honest README with 24-bug audit findings, top README updated 2→3 suites. Results absent pending approved clean run. Not merged.","activeForm":"Pushing benchmark into brain-bench","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"87","subject":"Part A: fully audit git-meta PR #1 + add CI","description":"DONE: git-meta audit (H1 target-value corruption HIGH + M1 CAS-clobber + M2 poison-consumer + M3 read-model regression + L1/L2) fixed, each with a pre-fix-failing regression test. Added .github/workflows/ci.yml with fail-closed insecure-symbol check. prod 70 / dev 76 green. Pushed to feat/git-meta-service-integration -> PR #1 (not merged). Core CAS/auth/build-tag verified clean by audit.","activeForm":"Auditing git-meta PR #1 + adding CI","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"88","subject":"Part B: entire-brain P0.M5 distribution docs (new PR)","description":"DONE: PR #73 entireio/entire-brain (docs/p0m5-install-docs). Rewrote getting-started.md (stub->real cold-start guide, entire graph provider) + polished announcement. Flagged 3 release-owner blockers: brain module path is ashtom/ not entireio; plugin install doesn't auto-resolve provider dep; verify v0.1.0 provider. Not merged, not published.","activeForm":"Writing entire-brain P0.M5 docs","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"89","subject":"Part C: entire-api P1.M7 EntireDB-push-down RFD","description":"DONE: RFD as docs/adr/0005-entiredb-storage-push-down.md pushed to m4-brain-auth -> PR #242. Blobs->objstore, CAS->refstore, audit->RSL, fact heads->git-meta records. Crypto-shred-vs-content-addressing flagged as the crux. Doc-only.","activeForm":"Writing P1.M7 RFD","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"90","subject":"Edit artifact + harness for full-300 3-model run (haiku→sonnet→opus)","description":"DONE (artifact+harness): stratify full mode merged (PR #37); artifact rewritten for full-300 3-model, split per-model, Max 20x staged, time+cost table, same URL. Full HAIKU run LIVE on this machine (brain-swebench, MODELS=haiku, 300x2, resumable, PID tracked) + hourly cron bc345159 reporting.","activeForm":"Building + launching full-official 3-model run","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]}],"itemCount":19},"type":"attachment","uuid":"1b609a9b-8c5d-4d48-97e8-c73123672282","timestamp":"2026-07-19