completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"83","subject":"Build 2-arm harness: mini-swe-agent +/- entire-graph","description":"Bake entire-sem into task containers, snapshot at base_commit, expose graph as bash tool in treated arm only. Same mini-swe-agent + Sonnet 5 both arms. Log tokens + tool calls per run.","activeForm":"Building 2-arm SWE-bench harness","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"84","subject":"Full official SWE-bench Multilingual (subscription): fix→rebuild→runner→await approval","description":"MEASURED-SETTLED: graph = token win (-19-23% vs whole-file-naive baseline, lean graph, full session), NOT accuracy lever (~0 across 4 configs: 100t +1/-3, enriched -3, budget40 -1). Enrichment + budget both backfired. Verdict in memory graph-swebench-verdict.md. No cheating.","activeForm":"Running pilot + scoring","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"85","subject":"git-meta-service: integrate → PR → audit","description":"DONE: feat/git-meta-service-integration → PR #1 (entirehq/git-meta-service). Finished auth build-tag gating (authn_dev.go), fixed create-race classifier + stale test. prod 48 tests, dev 54 tests, both build modes green. Audit skipped per user. Not merged.","activeForm":"Integrating + PR + audit for git-meta-service","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"86","subject":"Push agentic-swebench benchmark properly into brain-bench","description":"DONE: agentic-swebench suite pushed to entirehq/brain-bench PR #32 (branch agentic-swebench-suite off clean origin/main). Proper suite layout (tools/tasks/tests/results) matching competitive-eval, honest README with 24-bug audit findings, top README updated 2→3 suites. Results absent pending approved clean run. Not merged.","activeForm":"Pushing benchmark into brain-bench","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"87","subject":"Part A: fully audit git-meta PR #1 + add CI","description":"DONE: git-meta audit (H1 target-value corruption