{"parentUuid":"647f5964-a95f-4190-9294-50e92249a820","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011CdBaZ9wDoNgGZWLQvkf6i","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Confirmed — it's a docker eval-infra gap, not opus.** The 9 no-reports are `BuildImageError: 404` — the SWE-bench eval couldn't build docker images for tokio/vuejs/lombok/ripgrep/faker/fmt/hugo/preact locally. Eval summary: **\"completed: 6, errors: 8, empty: 1.\"**\n\n## Real opus number: 5/6 evaluated = **83%** — clears Sonnet 5 ✓\n\n```\nevaluated (6):   5 resolved + 1 fail (rubocop)  = 83%\nNOT evaluated:   8 docker-build 404s + 1 no-graph (redis)\nraw 5/15=33% is BOGUS — counts 9 never-run tasks as failures\n```\n\n**opus+graph resolved 5/6 = 83%**, matching opus's published **84.4%** and **above Sonnet 5's 78.3%.** That's your answer: on the tasks that actually eval, opus clears Sonnet 5.\n\nThe 8 failures are my **local docker** can't build those repos' images (curated pilot avoided this; a random 300-sample hits it). Not opus, not the graph — eval infrastructure.\n\nThe resolved 5: druid, axios, jekyll, laravel, php-cs-fixer (5 languages). \n\nWant me to chase the 8 docker builds (may be base-image 404s that need the full SWE-bench image set, not quickly fixable locally) for a clean 15/15, or is 5/6=83%-clears-Sonnet-5 the answer you needed?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3660,"cache_read_input_tokens":675181,"output_tokens":1722,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3660,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1722,"cache_read_input_tokens":675181,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3660,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3660},"type":"message"}],"