cp.json`, `.cursor/`, `.gemini/`, `.claude/skills/`, `.codex/skills/` so no one runs `git add -A`. *Opening the PR needs your approval.*\n6. **Reconcile the three known cleanups**: fix `docs/ga-readiness.md` gates 9 and 10 (table says ⏳, the resolved section says ✅ — pick one); refresh the stale `.entire/graph-agent.md` doctrine copy; delete the 8 subsumed/squash-residue codex branches on **both** remotes.\n\n**Two things nobody has done and everyone is assuming:** the confirmatory benchmark run that all of PR #75's eval hardening exists to enable has **never been executed** (budget-gated), and the Hit@8 0/8→6/8 headline is **not currently reproducible** — fix or explicitly waive that before any of those numbers are cited outside the repo.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"26b1a4b8-d817-4e62-96ee-e983ad85228c","session_id":"08c113b1-6073-41d6-9c88-fa9632538501","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
