{"parentUuid":"8717dbc5-0993-42e6-9441-b91d98090d51","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011CdZPWM7PyGxMwkxyDCkVF","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# entire-brain — where we are (2026-07-30)\n\n**Headline: nothing is blocked on anyone else. Main quiet 16 days, 3 open PRs, all with zero reviews/comments for ~13 days.**\n\n## Main\n- Tip `afe7d3f2` (07-19) \"Rename brain-bench to **GraphMark**\" — docs-only, 1 file. Last *code* merges were 07-12→07-14.\n- Direction: (1) prove memory causally helps — #71 + #66 added ~15K lines of preregistered ablation/causal harness, commit note \"memory HELPS\"; (2) facts became a trust surface — #68 vitality receipts, #69 pending-review surfacing; (3) consolidation onto Entire Graph (#72).\n- **GraphMark is external only** — zero code refs, no submodule, no CI job in brain. Only prose in `docs/ga-readiness.md`.\n\n## Open PRs\n**#73 — P0.M5 install docs** · docs-only, 2 files +372/−104 · **CI 14/14 green, MERGEABLE/CLEAN** · zero feedback 13d.\n→ Ready to merge. Closes the last non-code P0 item. *Needs your approval.*\n\n**#74 — git-meta local fact store + `facts sync`** (mine) · 17 files +2,668 · **CI RED**, 3 mechanical breaks:\n- `syscall.Flock` is unix-only → kills all 3 Windows jobs (needs `lock_unix.go`/`lock_windows.go`)\n- `gofmt` unformatted `backend_test.go`\n- PR body documents the *old* blob key (pre-`bdd7ee33`)\n→ I can fix all 3 without approval. Shared publication still blocked on **entiredb reserved-ref unblock**.\n\n**#75 — brief retrieval + eval hardening** (ashtom, draft) · **552 files, +199,356, 11 real conflicts, `mergeable=false`** — GitHub won't even render the diff (406).\n→ Unlandable as-is. Product code is only 30 Go files (+6,548); the other 477 files are benchmark corpora. Needs an A/B split.\n\n## Local work (your checkout)\nOn `feat/init-agents`, **1 behind / 4 ahead** — 3 of those 4 commits *are* PR #74. Real new work = `d0ba1e06` **init-agents** (3 files, +221): installs `.entire/brain-agent.md` + marker-guarded blocks into `AGENTS.md`/`CLAUDE.md`, idempotent. Builds, tests, vet clean. **Never pushed**, stacked on unmerged #74, zero docs.\n⚠️ **`git add -A` hazard**: 10 untracked entries, none gitignored — including machine-local `regente` junk with hardcoded `/Users/suhaan/…` paths and a 2.9 MB `.regente/`.\n\n## Milestones\n- **P0: gates 1–11 satisfied.** Only remaining item is P0.M5 = PR #73. (`ga-readiness.md` self-conflicts on gates 9+10: table says ⏳, resolved section says ✅.)\n- **P1 merged:** M1.1 wire contract, M1.5 publish client, M2.2 merge engine, M2.3 fact-sync runner, M2.4 conflict routing, M3.3 remote MCP client. **M1.3/M1.4 not started.** M1.2 server store lives in entire-api, not here.\n- Durable facts: B1–B4 landed, **Phase D (embeddings) in progress**.\n- Claim posture: semantic usefulness **claimable** (28/30 languages, p<0.05); distill wall-clock and durable-facts-vs-raw **no claim**.\n\n## Branches / issues\n- 53 unmerged `codex/*` names, but really **one lineage** — 44 are single commits off a shared trunk; PR #75 aggregates their content. 8 are deletable (subsumed/squash residue), mirrored on both remotes so cleanup deletes twice.\n- `codex/current-main-source-of-truth` (07-24, 156 unique commits) is the only branch on *current* main — likely #75's successor.\n- **Zero issues, ever.** All work tracked via PRs/branches.\n\n## Two unvalidated assumptions\n1. The confirmatory benchmark that all of #75's eval hardening exists to enable has **never been run** (budget-gated).\n2. The Hit@8 0/8→6/8 headline is **not reproducible** (replay can't open the SQLite stores).\nFix or explicitly waive before citing those numbers outside the repo.\n\n## What I'd do next\n1. **Merge #73** (green, clean, last P0 item) — your approval\n2. **Fix #74's CI** (windows flock split + gofmt + body) — I can start now\n3. **Split #75** into product-PR (~30 files) vs benchmark-PR (477 files) — the corpora-in-git call is yours and cuts ~90%\n4. **Land init-agents** — cherry-pick onto fresh branch off main, gitignore the regente junk\n5. Reconcile ga-readiness gates 9/10; delete the 8 dead branches on both remotes\n\nWant me to start on #74's CI fixes (no merge, just push to the branch)?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6011,"cache_read_input_tokens":474056,"output_tokens":2707,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6011,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2707,"cache_read_input_tokens":474056,"cache_creation_input_tokens":6011,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":6011},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011CdZPWHtRdGf9cdgCh9FNu","type":"assistant","uuid":"1536e90d-0040-4fd4-9ee4-6689249ba5d6","timestamp":"2026-07-31T03:01:14.200Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"08c113b1-6073-41d6-9c88-fa9632538501","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.219","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
