zing dispositions (merged/addressed/closed).","activeForm":"Issue comments + Peyton message","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"78","subject":"Build graph/semantic source for 4 product-repo brains","description":"Run refresh sessions + history + index (semantic via entire sem) for cli, entire-api, entire.io, entiredb. Verify semantic:true and no repo tree dirtied. Phase 1, running as 4 bg jobs.","activeForm":"Building graph/semantic source for 4 repos","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"79","subject":"Distill facts — entire-api (haiku, finishing); cli partial; db/io skipped","description":"entire-api: resumed 90/230 on haiku (~$14, honors $25 cap), flushes facts at completion, monitored. cli: graph built + usable but facts ~29% partial (killed), left per skip-spend. entiredb + entire.io: skipped (no cross-repo yet). Agent-usage rule wired into ~/.claude/CLAUDE.md (global) + devenv/CLAUDE.md; entire-brain MCP global.","activeForm":"Distilling durable facts for 4 repos","status":"in_progress","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"80","subject":"Create devenv multi-repo brain workspace","description":"entire brain workspace create + add the 4 product repo keys so agents can query/search/review across all repos in one call.","activeForm":"Creating devenv brain workspace","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"81","subject":"Verify agents can query the brains end-to-end","description":"Test brain_query / brain_impact / workspace query against real repos; confirm structural + fact answers return. Report what agents now get.","activeForm":"Verifying agent brain queries","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"82","subject":"SWE-bench Multilingual: fetch + stratify ~30 pilot tasks","description":"Install datasets, load real SWE-bench_Multilingual, stratify 3-4 tasks/language across all 9, save pilot_tasks.json + print distribution.","activeForm":"Fetching + stratifying SWE-bench Multilingual pilot","status":"