{"parentUuid":"67618f6e-6866-4f66-a1d5-e969f2caf408","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cde4hh4ZKvKQe3oZxNuK5","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Building now (`wzompd6po`, 10 agents, two sequential chains in isolated worktrees — main checkouts untouched).\n\n**Plan per PR:**\n\n**#75 / entire-brain** (chain of 6)\n1. Merge main in → resolve 11 conflicts (main wins on refactors/package moves, branch wins on its new brief features; `getting-started.md` stays main's stub, not re-inflated)\n2. Fold PR #74's `internal/factgitmeta` + **fix its 2 CI breaks** (split flock into `lock_unix.go`/`lock_windows.go`; gofmt)\n3. **M1.3 canonical encoding** — `internal/brainwire/canonical.go`: HTML-escaping off, lexicographic key order, normative `omitempty`, UTC/Z time policy, integer + minimal-escape string rules, foreign-byte canonicalizer, no JSON tag changes\n4. **M1.4 manifest signing** — ed25519 over canonical bytes, versioned envelope (alg + key id + encoding version), signature commits to every referenced blob digest\n5. **#64's two deferrals** — open-proposal-set HTTP transport (list/get/apply/reject + hostedbrain client) and the user-facing CLI verbs, hosted path opt-in two-gate per ADR-P1-A, no default-behavior change\n6. **P0 close-out** — fold #73's docs into main's README-centric layout, reconcile `ga-readiness.md` gates 9/10\n\n**#242 / entire-api** (chain of 2)\n1. Merge main → resolve conflicts (preserve `brainbuild`/`brainquery`/`brainstore` + ADRs 0004/0005)\n2. Server counterparts: proposal-set endpoints under existing repo-tenancy authz, manifest/blob-digest integrity enforcement on ingest, goose migrations if needed\n\nThen a verify pass on each: build, **windows cross-build**, vet, gofmt, full tests — fix until green.\n\nNothing pushed. When it lands I'll show you what changed and what's green, then you decide on pushing to those two branches (#75 is ashtom's, so that's your call specificall