{"parentUuid":"a63bafba-dbaa-4344-aa85-9116518e67d0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5QQ9e9LqAXrArhMhEQq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Pure self-contradiction confirmed: the doc's own resolved §1/§2 say both are done, but rows 9/10 still say ⏳. Making the minimal accurate fix:"}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1885,"cache_read_input_tokens":546451,"output_tokens":793,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":244},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1885,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":793,"cache_read_input_tokens":546451,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1885},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce5QQ6HV9F33pPK234Qox","type":"assistant","uuid":"104e3a69-cbd6-4ee5-be8f-f25f3488c8fc","timestamp":"2026-08-15T23:30:20.784Z","effort":"xhigh","session_id":"f507d58c-285f-4d11-b1d0-201f2a5e172d","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p0-docs","sessionId":"de272aad-c620-4d71-bbdd-27dd2d3dc8af","version":"2.1.233","gitBranch":"main","slug":"quizzical-sniffing-quasar"}
{"parentUuid":"104e3a69-cbd6-4ee5-be8f-f25f3488c8fc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Ce5QQ9e9LqAXrArhMhEQq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UXg3aZ1Uvhi6LWv6bheZcb","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/suhaan/devenv/p0p1/p0-docs/docs/ga-readiness.md","old_string":"| 9 | Release blockers B1 + R1–R4 confirmed closed on RC SHA | ⏳ verify | re-run `mise run release:readiness` on the tagged SHA; see `docs/release-blockers.md` |\n| 10 | Tagged `main` on `entire-graph` **and** `entire-brain`, aligned | ⏳ partial | `entire-graph` `v0.1.0` cut; `entire-brain` tag pending (this SHA) |","new_string":"| 9 | Release blockers B1 + R1–R4 confirmed closed on RC SHA | ✅ done | `mise run release:evidence` on the RC SHA: 0 hard integrity flags, 24/24 records with required provenance. See \"GA cut — resolved\" §1 and `docs/release-blockers.md` |\n| 10 | Tagged `main` on `entire-graph` **and** `entire-brain`, aligned | ✅ done | both cut `v0.1.0` on the aligned GA SHA. See \"GA cut — resolved\" §2 and \"Provider compatibility since the GA cut\" below |"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1885,"cache_read_input_tokens":546451,"output_tokens":793,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":244},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1885,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":793,"cache_read_input_tokens":546451,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1885,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1885},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ce5QQ6HV9F33pPK234Qox","type":"assistant","uuid":"da495fd2-ae1c-4a2f-95ca-229d45c36168","timestam